{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0212_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d5dbf8d68ef1c8fb0fd396ff4ccef5846e2cbe39cb71e680161b2b755a9991d9", "ja": "（さて、今日のレッスンルームは、\n翼たちで最後か……一応、チェックしておくかな）", "zh": "（那么，今天的练习室里，最后是翼她们吗……\n姑且检查一下吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0212_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2663e46cf72baa11294b5a5ec3b6f869033b1399c7fbe0a01b8caa74e9eee5bd", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん！　掃除が終わったら\n一緒に帰りませんか～？　ちょっと待ってて～！", "zh": "{$P$}先～生！等我打扫完了\n要不要一起回去呀～？稍微等我一下哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0212_1002_p", "source_sha256": "866bb8a85b4954c21ecd5b0a525d16a84b55ff57b779b93b9927f0ab6a5d99c0", "ja": "あれ？　翼がひとりでレッスンルームの掃除を\nしてるのか？　珍しいな。", "zh": "咦？是翼一个人在打扫练习室吗？\n真少见啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0212_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "baabbd181e7129065fb0668aa3fd645748af884a4352090615d5c1b4e534c8c7", "ja": "ううっ、実は……「今日はジャンケンで勝った人が\n掃除ね！」って事になっちゃって。", "zh": "呜呜，其实……变成了“今天猜拳赢了的人\n负责打扫！”这样的情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0212_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "be0ef292ea0401eb99a077cb76481d3f2fb8233bf01da9a2964a6ae01471f816", "ja": "わたしってジャンケンすっごく強いから、\n勝ち抜いちゃったんですよ～。", "zh": "我猜拳超级厉害的，\n结果一路赢到了最后啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0212_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bad57632ef94906457604b1450cee0be6d9e4e4670543964f02ab99a9910d46a", "ja": "なるほど、勝ちたくなくても、勝ってしまうんだな。\nでも、結構キレイになったじゃないか。", "zh": "原来如此，就算不想赢，也还是会赢啊。不过，已经打扫得挺干净了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0212_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "610467ca1e6a05247d153de46d7ad9e975e31c13e229b12cff7009496d61d723", "ja": "えへへ、歌いながらやってたら、\n意外とはかどっちゃったんですよね。", "zh": "嘿嘿，一边唱歌一边做，没想到还挺顺利的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0212_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0f1a59d2a3d304b8d352a7b54ee8c4b14f3a30b3a2a69002a7a8d812102af641", "ja": "よし！　俺も手伝うから、ぱぱっとやっちゃおう。\n遅くなってもいけないし。", "zh": "好！我也来帮忙，咱们赶紧搞定吧。\n可不能拖到太晚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0212_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8e5c878f62cab674f8e5c3a30b8ce6741344dc1e2b811a843ca10401cecb67f5", "ja": "やった～♪　そうこなくっちゃ！\nじゃあわたし、応援歌歌ってますから。", "zh": "太好啦～♪　这就对了嘛！\n那我来唱加油歌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0212_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d9e521a774d924f38e91d00df1957e56613c1a05464d70c3131d06cb9deae75a", "ja": "フレー、フレー、{$P$}さーん！\nナイスモップがけ～♪　イェーイ！", "zh": "加油，加油，{$P$}先生——！\n拖地拖得漂亮～♪ 耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
